    longDescription:
      'Most dating apps open with the whole country and let you filter down. DriftDate does the opposite: it starts where you are and widens only when you ask it to.\n\n—— Layers ——\n\nDiscovery expands in steps — ZIP code, then county, then state, then everywhere. You choose when to move outward, so "nearby" actually means nearby, and you see your own area properly before it gets diluted.\n\n—— Safety is part of the product ——\n\nCOARSE LOCATION, ALWAYS\nYour position is deliberately blurred before it is ever used. Raw coordinates are never exposed to another user, and no one can see exactly where you are.\n\nTRUST PASSPORT AND TRUST SCORE\nSee what has actually been verified about someone, rather than guessing from photos.\n\nSAFETY CENTRE\nBlocking, reporting and safety guidance in one place, not buried in settings.\n\nBLOCK LIST\nBlock anyone, at any time. Blocks are immediate and permanent unless you undo them.\n\n—— Talking to people ——\n\nCHAT WITH REPLY SUGGESTIONS\nWhen a conversation stalls, DriftDate can suggest a reply, with the tone matched to the thread rather than one generic template.\n\nDATE PLANNER\nWork out where to actually go, together.\n\nAI COMPATIBILITY\nA read on what you have in common, shown as reasons rather than a bare number.\n\n—— Honest about what this is ——\n\nDriftDate is for adults looking to meet other adults. It is 17+. Meeting someone from the internet carries real risk: tell a friend where you are going, meet in public first, and use the Safety Centre. We verify what we can and cannot vouch for anyone.',
